and necessary documents.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office:</strong> For more info, call (205) 884-2395 or visit the <a href=\"https://www.stclairco.com/221/Revenue-Commissioner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Revenue Commissioner&#8217;s Office</mark></a>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/St.-Clair-County-Courthouse-in-Pell-City-Alabama-296x197.png 296w, https: